src/expressions/to_datafusion/{expression,predicate,scalar,utils}.rs are
each derived from the file of the same name in the `datafusion-executor`
crate in that repository at commit 04c2ec32 (main, 2026-10-16), with the
entry points renamed to `to_datafusion_expr`, `to_datafusion_predicate_expr`
and `to_datafusion_scalar`.

src/query/mod.rs and src/query/operator.rs take their plan walk and
operator lowerings from datafusion-executor/src/plan.rs and
datafusion-executor/src/operator.rs at the same commit.
